                  "value": "<p>Studying interaction of political and economical processes within and between countries and their influence on international relations since world war II. National file: demographic data / economic data: production / capital formation / imports / exports / expenditures / revenues / consumption / transportation / telecommunication / military personnel and equipment / international file: exports / cooperative actions / conflict actions / distance. Background variables: residence</p>"
